error[E5005]: cannot move out of 's' because it is borrowed
  --> main.prism:10:13
   10 |     consume(s)
      |             ^ 's' is moved here while borrowed
  --> main.prism:9:25
    9 |     val c = composition { println(s.value) }
      |                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ the closure captures 's' weakly here
  --> main.prism:9:35
    9 |     val c = composition { println(s.value) }
      |                                   ^ borrow occurs due to this use of 's' in the closure
  --> main.prism:11:13
   11 |     println(c.recompose())
      |             ^ borrow later used here
   = note: a closure given to an attached parameter captures 's' weakly, so what keeps it, such as a composition, keeps 's' borrowed while it is used
   = help: declare 's' before the composition, so that it outlives the composition's last use, or remember it in the composition's content
